        <mxCell id="k7t" value="&lt;b&gt;Stale attestation token replayed to pass off a retired enclave as live&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9fb0c3&quot;&gt;key-bound only when the verifier encrypts (Crucible requires it); no freshness nonce anywhere — the runner never fills the slot&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#dbe4f0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
