        <mxCell id="foot" value="analyze everything · mitigate the cheap channels · declare the rest honestly — both open gaps are cheap AND total, which is exactly why they are the next things to close" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#9fb0c3;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
